{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Miasma|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Cassiopeia
|skill        = W
|icon         = Miasma.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Cassiopeia}} spews several clouds of {{tip|Poison}} that linger, continually dealing {{as|magic damage}} to enemies within. They are also {{tip|slow|slowed}} and {{tip|ground|grounded}}.
|blurb2       = {{tip|Grounded}} enemies cannot use Movement abilities.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Cassiopeia''' spews forth 7 bolts of venom in an arc at the target location, creating toxic clouds at the area for 5 seconds.
|description2 = Enemies within the clouds are {{tip|poison|poisoned}} to take {{as|magic damage}} every {{ap|5/19|round=3}} seconds and become {{tip|ground|grounded}} and {{tip|slow|slowed}} by an amount that decays over the area's duration.
|leveling2    = {{st|Magic Damage Per Second|{{ap|20 to 40}} {{as|(+ 10% AP)}}|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|100 to 200}} {{as|(+ 50% AP)}}}}
{{st|Slow|{{ap|40 to 80}}%}}
|target range = 700
|effect radius= {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|200|Individual poison clouds}}
|angle        = <!--{{tt|X{{degree}}|Angle between clouds on the radius}}-->
|speed        = 3000
|cooldown     = {{ap|24 to 16}}
|cost         = {{ap|70 to 90}}
|costtype     = Mana
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|queue time   = {{fd|0.35}}
|targeting    = Location
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Magic
|spelleffects = aoedot
|spellshield  = False
|projectile   = True
|knockdown    = 
|grounded     = 
|outofrange   = cast at max
|notes        = 
* ''Miasma's'' {{tip|slow}} and {{tip|ground}} debuffs are each marked as non-dispellable, so they are not removed by most {{tip|cleanse|cleanses}}. Each is however allowed to be removed by cleanses that '''also''' grant immunity to the debuff type, such as {{cai|Ragnarok|Olaf}}.
* If a target becomes {{tip|untargetable}} while affected by the {{tip|ground}}, the debuff will refresh to {{fd|0.25}} seconds.
* {{ai|Wind Wall|Yasuo}} will block the portion of ''Miasma'' it destroys.
* ''Miasma'' inflicts {{as|{{ap|5 to 10}}|magic damage}} {{as|(+ {{fd|2.5}}% AP)}} {{as|magic damage}} per tick, and in fact because there is 19 ticks and not 20 ticks, the {{as|'''total''' magic damage}} is currently not {{as|{{ap|100 to 200}} {{as|(+ 50% AP)}}|magic damage}} but {{as|{{ap|95 to 190}}|magic damage}} {{as|(+ {{fd|47.5}}% AP)}}.
** Sometimes ''Miasma'' randomly inflicts only 18 ticks of damage.{{bug}}
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Petrifying Gaze|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Cassiopeia
|skill        = R
|icon         = Petrifying Gaze.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Cassiopeia}} blasts in a cone, dealing {{as|magic damage}} to enemies hit and {{tip|stun|stunning}} any that are facing her, while {{tip|slow|slowing}} any others with their back turned.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Cassiopeia''' blasts enemies in a cone in the target direction, dealing {{as|magic damage}} to enemies struck within and {{tip|slow|slowing}} them by 40% for 2 seconds. Enemies with their facing direction towards her are instead {{tip|stun|stunned}} for the same duration.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|150 to 350}} {{as|(+ 50% AP)}}}}
|effect radius= {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|850|950 but starts 100 units behind Cassiopeia. Because of this, range is slightly greater laterally}}
|angle        = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|80{{degree}}|Pending for test}}
|cooldown     = {{ap|120 to 80}}
|cost         = 100
|costtype     = mana
|targeting    = Direction
|cast time    = {{fd|0.5}}
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Magic
|spelleffects = spellaoe
|spellshield  = True
|projectile   = False
|knockdown    = 
|grounded     = 
|notes        = 
{{Effect at cast time end}}
* Regarding ''Petrifying Gaze'' applying the {{tip|stun}}, ''facing '''Cassiopeia''''' means facing the opposite general ''direction'' (angle) as her; this direction bisects an 180 degree arc of a radius through her and her enemy. In other words, effectively, she must be "looking" toward the enemy.
* '''Cassiopeia''' will turn to face the target direction over the cast time.
** ''Petrifying Gaze's'' target direction will change if '''Cassiopeia's''' facing direction changes during the cast time (i.e. through {{tip|airborne|knockbacks}}).
*** The visual effect will not follow changes in '''Cassiopeia's''' facing direction and may not portray ''Petrifying Gaze's'' target direction accurately.{{bug}}
* The facing direction of champions whose abilities/animations cause them to lock their facing or spin is always the direction they are moving in. For abilities that cause the champion to spin in place (e.g. {{ai|Death Lotus|Katarina}}, {{ai|Judgment|Garen}}) it will factor the direction they were facing on cast.
** {{cai|R|Lucian}} is an exception and his facing direction is actually considered to be the direction he is facing.
}}

