{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Pale Cascade|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Diana
|skill        = W
|icon         = Pale Cascade.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Diana}} {{tip|shield|shields}} herself, creating three orbiting spheres that detonate on contact with enemies to deal {{as|magic damage}} in an area.
|blurb2       = If all the spheres detonate, she gains more {{tip|shield}}.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Diana''' grants herself a {{tip|shield}} for up to 5 seconds and creates three spheres that orbit her counterclockwise for the same duration, detonating upon contact with an enemy to deal {{as|magic damage}} to nearby enemies.
|leveling     = {{st|Shield Strength|{{ap|45 to 105}} {{as|(+ 30% AP)}} {{as|(+ 11% '''bonus''' health)}}}}
{{st|Magic Damage per Orb|{{ap|20 to 68}} {{as|(+ 18% AP)}}|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|20*3 to 68*3}} {{as|(+ 54% AP)}}}}
|icon2        = Pale Cascade 2.png
|description2 = If all three spheres detonate, ''Pale Cascade's'' shield is reapplied, stacking with its original shield and refreshing the duration.
|leveling2    = {{st|Maximum Shield Strength|{{ap|45*2 to 105*2}} {{as|(+ 60% AP)}} {{as|(+ {{ap|11*2}}% '''bonus''' health)}}}}
|effect radius= {{tt|200|Orbit and explosion}}
|cast time    = none
|cooldown     = {{ap|15 to 9}}
|cdstart      = After sphere detonation
|cost         = {{ap|40 to 60}}
|costtype     = mana
|targeting    = Auto
|damagetype   = Magic
|projectile   = True
|spelleffects = spellaoe
|spellshield  = True
|affects      = Self, Enemies
|notes        = 
* On the second application of ''Pale Cascade's'' shield, {{sti|Shield Power|link = Heal and shield power}} will apply to both the new shield amount and the shield amount remaining from the first shield, which has already benefited from ''shield power''.
** Because of this, ''shield power'' effectively applies to the second shield twice, but with reduced efficiency, for up to an increase of 50% of ''shield power'' (maximum benefit if no damage was mitigated by the first shield). With 10% ''shield power'', the second shield's total amount will be increased by up to an additional 5%, for a total of {{tt|{{fd|15.5%}}|1.1*1.05}} '''bonus''' shield.
** The formula for the total amount of shield '''Diana''' will receive from both shield applications is:
*** ''Total Shield = (((Shield Amount × (1 + Shield Power)) - Damage Blocked by Shield) + Shield Amount) × (1 + Shield Power)''
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Tactical Sweep|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Camille
|skill        = W
|icon         = Tactical Sweep.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Camille}} briefly becomes {{tip|ghosted}} and sweeps her leg after a delay, dealing {{as|physical damage}} to enemies hit in a cone. Enemies in the outer half are slowed and take increased damage, while also {{tip|healing}} her.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Camille''' sweeps her leg in a cone in the target direction over {{fd|1.1}} seconds, during which she is {{tip|ghosted}} and unable to declare basic attacks. Afterwards, she deals {{as|physical damage}} to all enemies within.
|leveling     = {{st|Physical Damage|{{ap|60 to 160}} {{as|(+ 60% '''bonus''' AD)}}}}
|description2 = Enemies hit by the outer half of the cone take {{as|'''additional''' physical damage|physical damage}}, capped at 300 against {{tip|monsters}}, and are {{tip|slow|slowed}} by 80% decaying over 2 seconds. '''Camille''' is {{tip|healing|healed}} for 100% of this '''additional''' damage {{tt|post-mitigation|After modifiers such as resistances}} against enemy {{tip|champions}} in the outer half.
|leveling2    = {{st|Outer Cone Additional Damage|{{as|{{ap|7 to 9}}% {{as|(+ {{fd|2.5}}% per 100 '''bonus''' AD)}} of target's '''maximum''' health}}}}
|description3 = Non-epic monsters take 50% damage from ''Tactical Sweep''.
|leveling3    = {{st|Non-Epic Monster Damage|{{ap|60/2 to 160/2}} {{as|(+ 30% '''bonus''' AD)}}}}
{{st|Bonus Non-Epic Monster Damage|{{as|{{ap|7/2 to 9/2}}% {{as|(+ {{fd|1.25}}% per 100 '''bonus''' AD)}} of target's '''maximum''' health}}}}
|description4 = ''Other abilities can be cast during the animation without cancelling it.''
|cooldown     = {{ap|12 to 10}}
|cost         = {{ap|50 to 70}}
|costtype     = Mana
|cast time    = none
|effect radius= {{dv|{{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|325|Inner radius}}|{{tt|650|Outer radius}}}}
|angle        = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|70{{degree}}|Pending for test}}
|targeting    = Direction
|affects      = Self, Enemies
|damagetype   = Physical
|spellshield  = true
|spelleffects = spellaoe
|projectile = False
|notes        = 
* '''Camille''' can move during the delay, but the hitbox and '''Camille's''' visuals are fixed to the initial target direction.
** '''Camille's''' facing-direction, for effects such as {{ai|Petrifying Gaze|Cassiopeia}}, is the direction she is moving, and not the direction the model is facing.
* The damage modifier against non-epic monsters applies after the cap.
* Because the increased damage in the outer range of the cone is dealt as an '''additional''' instance of damage (as opposed to '''bonus''' damage to the original instance), it will trigger effects twice such as being reduced by {{ri|Bone Plating}} an extra time.{{bug|2}}
** It still belongs to the same {{tip|cast instance}}, therefore it does not trigger additional stacks of {{ri|Conqueror}} or {{ri|Electrocute}}.
}}

